{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261022/photo/bkn-20261022001830896-1022_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261022071243\"/><p>行動中7名內地女子被捕。</p><p>荃灣區警員聯同相關部門根據線報及經深入調查後，昨日（21日）展開代號「嶺馬」的掃黃行動。人員於川龍街、眾安街、海壩街及二陂坊一帶，共拘捕7名內地女子，年齡介乎31至47歲，涉嫌「違反逗留條件」。所有被捕人正被扣留調查，稍後將交相關部門跟進。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T23:21:50.244044+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T16:18:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T23:38:05.072957+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T23:17:57.837799+00:00","content_hash":"b1acc0508acef964b64c8b4dce305d0b72dae1c3c8c4a5cdc7c61b6f79e1f881","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}